hysical crit chance by %d%%, and prevent death until -%d%% life.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使半径 %d 格内的挖掘魔陷入狂乱，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t狂乱使其全局速度提高 %d%%、物理暴击率提高 %d%%，并使其在生命值降至 -%d%% 前不会死亡。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0c7a3ad083534f0a25232d565e0b7a233385121058a2d8167af198028886f73e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"64f8d3380142a340468aac02a7750309ceee21f528a8e58e7b40c6c5ad184e45","logical_entry_identity":"6faad3f661d77ae0771d81bd94c6c4174dbf37047b7520e7052eb9bd3311357b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GREY#(see trap description)#LAST#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GREY#（见陷阱描述）#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2c70d03dc818fdc071e98189f0a5ed2f57d2e4ac749437b9117965deded3d137","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"65021ec19eb6f4a15c47f14b26c69d1cce785424f9d51403478bbbb158129d07","logical_entry_identity":"413c5ffe6776d90b52598113c97dede6bda5bc178fcc0bf772edc7a21db0c3d3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Elemental Surge","source_tag":"talent name","target":"元素狂潮"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3231aa667cb160145a527eace47d64db4542d1f84a100d84f5d93108eefcafae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6503797f6d218f684a5f98906a6e0912f543da9cb46e7f9757331fc675da9a1c","logical_entry_identity":"f44ed99de63dea5902ef37ea0f8a87e3f9544ad63336268d30f6e71bc3addfe1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is no longer cursed.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#不再被诅咒。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f31f86a82fc3514e636ba5e4c3021c85248a2ab0a380ec5c85dec3b6aedc5fe2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6507e42b0ec7c62c40c647f3b942c1368a3a499f46c446e3e2339d715b74af73","logical_entry_identity":"4100e3623a007e9e0ff2f8c9f8a9b2ac9ea19961bf7ab8516dd8cc018d40883c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This knowledge comes with a heavy price and the Solipsist must guard his thoughts, lest he come to believe that the world exists only within his own mind.","source_tag":"_t","target":"使用此理论需要付出巨大的代价，织梦者必须对自己的思维有很强的控制力，否则他将会失去自我，世界于他而言将成为虚幻。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"30e853a89a0ffa8228d0f7f8740b09758019f31fcda6a0fe460bcf1f0d9ae1b0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"650b16b4fcf940a37d42cf1cfe37257c5f3583ab5c0a6bac78517aac97d67fe0","logical_entry_identity":"092f6041c00d483440776f446bcb64250e67c686cc6ecf43b51f6da9f77ea2d3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"increase all damage penetration by %d%% for 2 turns","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在2回合内增加%d%%全体伤害抗性穿透"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef7ecd9ba4dde634b8ed06230b0a5ee9edaa77a37ec108de112a018598f5bcdb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"650e026f940ec2e09aa2ca3b0152eafc43847b11cc8f9ea68e83eaef7c700a92","logical_entry_identity":"2e9bdc461671ffc6bde2af303be6abd571f4b0e750ecfbe2440865782b0c9c2c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Evasion","source_tag":"_t","target":"+躲闪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"49a868df71a14a59258dc2a1288ef5a3fc939d0b1d9d67bd3a51fb9d83555cf2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"650efbf704fda1e16a144f6fe564ebb9b8b18583346b837e5215965a2cfd59b8","logical_entry_identity":"40c4c93befc9fb50835597502c32bfcde339d7385c698fc28f8d1a05a629e1cf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The number of lines to display in the combat log (for the Classic HUD).","source_tag":"_t","target":"战斗日志显示行数 (只用于经典HUD)。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd5f47ba96dafb0770c95c6637b213a2ab9c144459e4a7bbad4aec94c31f9de1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6512c34bd989ff58893c1b3fdc6633fe76766407f20b73baf1ca8062dd77b289","logical_entry_identity":"f52aa5569349cf721b9800e2ee7c22c8ce167a35f77a5ccf3a2b0a84e2bfe7ce","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target#'s adrenaline surge has come to an end.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#的肾上腺素效果消失。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3d477d1cae121b7915a2f066a1376d97d30b36bdc690f637d5515a3d2a7630e8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"651d0698d92b6ca3808169473343b6a50ec2bc00e5cf815efc84155417044c14","logical_entry_identity":"d03955c6fb73216e81678db8051e10abfb51e4d9565b3dc6a16a0c3cfdd8d93a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#YELLOW#YOU NEED NOT CONCERN YOURSELF WITH SUCH THINGS. I KNOW YOU CRAVE POWER. I KNOW THE WEIGHT OF THE WORLD IS ON YOUR SHOULDERS. SO, ACCEPT MY BOONS. ALLOW ME TO HELP YOU.\n","source_tag":"chat","target":"#YELLOW#你无需为这些事操心。我知道你渴望力量。我知道整个世界的重担都压在你的肩上。所以，接受我的赐福吧。让我来助你一臂之力。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c2e3272d50d6a76d2ed5a4ec7622c72b57968cc23c798bf5ba4c2557a5203206","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"651fbae55a98bd001a15ebd8e6614c59b1f004dbc7f27c22b5cff0a228b66c45","logical_entry_identity":"e6cc4dcd365f52d1d184fd96ab251762f3c58613338df4b0cf053c81904bb677","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"By covering yourself in fungus, you better your healing.","source_tag":"_t","target":"利用真菌环绕周身，增强你的治疗能力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6afa0164e70ad36ddd13b35b726b5a7063e6df2b66ea2622133d5b5afc33ff1f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6520d8f3829e9a1b5a4ff50e5b0ee22186685921b7325af9a19efd75731e196c","logical_entry_identity":"d88eb8da3bb7100574c96814b7a4376bb777ca2144dc8ec17b4fbc95dc3322d8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spread diseases to your foes.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在你的目标中传播疾病。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"afea6e9f99fca2410daf8adae0507438fd1a2a819e2378c98cf2d0ee7e14345c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6520f92622f3c1ead78f4d56f7aacc1bfe224a5f4c71e88feaffb0d9bae428dc","logical_entry_identity":"5d830e203804f3de927047a20d19701609f4b371700c558867862a7a48e2914d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"White Hair 1","source_tag":"_t","target":"白发1"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"91153c6ba3d8f54e94ca6fb8bf2a7be6a970a23cf52a77bdab95eb62e2eb2e20","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6521a51c78aac4881a760ce068ce95300641bf62a87faa4431b88f8b2e9d89aa","logical_entry_identity":"c9b20fb84c8645f9cc9810c21611a7c5d041715c1c6ee765bad38255da89dbf8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Use 10 Fortress energy to send a powerful blast to the ground, directly below the Fortress, heavily damaging any creatures caught inside.\n\tRequires being in flight above the ground of a planet.","source_tag":"_t","target":"消耗 10 点堡垒能量，将一股强大的爆炸能量送到地面，重创任何区域内的敌人。\n\t需要在某个星球的空中飞行。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f65e6e8e9ea9967cabaec70f14f0f73a59c7dc13649b62fa32b4a677bbc8b32f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6522caaed7ed837fa0b5f5edf31e0be5423b727626265cac24593cac23251790","logical_entry_identity":"fb35731606f532bdef0715ea8932226608cba101f28c7c43350dc546d3d7f2af","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Highly Trained Mind","source_tag":"talent name","target":"精神训练"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"53c3885453bd5a29985ed0992fe0b8ce4b6cc5ed837667222db8c81a78d2993a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6527703e311daa43ca927eafee0efb5ba385ddf939e9e4a10edba0e4668ae3e1","logical_entry_identity":"659ae729c31b58476052c0ed2309eefc7a68c03c9eeb37b7ed25d2035e9ff0e6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I found it... the abomination Aeryn sent me to seek out. The breeding pits of the orcs... It is more vile than you can imagine... They have it hidden away from their encampments, out of sight of all their people. Their mothers, their young, all there - all vulnerable!\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*She pulls out a sketched map, and with some effort puts it in your palm.*#WHITE#\n\nThis could be the final solution, the end to the war... forever. We must strike soon, before reinforcements...\n\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*She looks hard at you, exerting all her effort into a final pleading stare.*#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"我找到了……艾琳派我寻找的那个丑恶之地。兽人育种棚……它比你能想象的还要邪恶……他们将其藏在远离营地的地方，避开了所有族人的视线。他们的母亲和幼儿都在那里——全都毫无防备！\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*她抽出一张手绘地图，吃力地将它放进你的手心。*#WHITE#\n\n这可能是最终解决方案，让战争终结……永远终结。我们必须尽快动手，赶在援军之前……\n\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*她直直地看着你，用尽全部力气投来最后恳求的目光。*#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2e5da4395657a02185700111080759c42315296d4d3c7eceb3fad241d596116c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6536f300d9c88321dba86d9b2c7b3589c3556a05546e60bad16e68223fa2b414","logical_entry_identity":"58428c70a542d26b12315ad02adae6c1941c28d88f2fb5ed689e55c31bcf96ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Well...  that was interesting.\n\nSetting up a portal took surprisingly little effort - conjured replicas of a Blood-Runed Athame and a Resonating Diamond work perfectly for setting up a portal, as it turns out, even if it burns them out after making just one.  This solution wouldn't work for the Orb of Many Ways, given that if it shorts out after one use, that means you're trapped on the other side of the portal, so I started working on a more tangible replica.  I noticed that most of them were disrupted by some form of interference, maybe echoes from the Spellblaze; my latest attempt at a more permanent orb was more of a curiosity than anything, an attempt to use those waves as constructive interference to lock onto their source.  I tossed a bandit through (my drolem's flight and relative silence have proven to be very convenient for securing test subjects!) with it tied to him, expecting him to pop into some magical maelstrom, quickly teleport back, and promptly die of terrible burn wounds (like the last four).\n\nI didn't get a bandit back.  I got an imp.\n\nMy drolem grabbed it with its jaws, as usual, but I told it to back off on seeing the imp wasn't armed and wasn't even trying to cast any spells.  I apologized, treated its wounds, then asked it to explain what happened to my test subject.  Apparently, the demons have been running their own portal experiments!  The test subject was unharmed when he popped up in their laboratory; after the demons \"questioned\" him (boiling tar was involved), they realized that another inquisitive mind was on the other side, and hoped to communicate and possibly trade data with that person.  I've managed to make more progress than the demons have - either I'm a genius, or I've severely overestimated the threat the demons pose!\n\nI've \"officially\" agreed to their deal - they'll supply me with materials, subjects, and what little progress they've made, and in return I've developed a modified orb that'll give them readings when it's used in a portal.  Needless to say, the readings are all bogus, and if they actually try to use those readings to make a second portal of their own, it'll blow them to bits.  The data they've given me has been VERY useful!  I've used it to construct a second altar from scratch - it still has some links to the demonic realm, but a single teleport with a genuine Orb of Many Ways will recalibrate it and cut those off completely, letting me get away scot-free with my knowledge and treasures, and preventing the demons from reaching me again.\n\nNow, I just need to get a genuine orb before the demons catch on...","source_tag":"_t","target":"嗯……这倒有意思。\n\n架设传送门所需的功夫少得惊人——事实证明，召唤出的两件复制品——血符仪式匕首和共鸣钻石——完全可以用来架设传送门，尽管造好一座后它们就会烧毁。这个办法却不适用于多元水晶球；它若用过一次便短路，就意味着使用者会被困在传送门另一边。因此，我开始研制一件实体复制品。我发现，多数复制品都会受到某种干扰，或许是魔法大爆炸的回响；最近那次制造更耐用水晶球的尝试主要只是出于好奇，我想利用这些波形成相长干涉，锁定它们的源头。我把水晶球绑在一个强盗身上，将他扔进传送门（龙傀儡会飞而且相对安静，事实证明很适合抓取实验对象！），原以为他会掉进某种魔法乱流，迅速传送回来，再立刻死于严重烧伤（就像前四个一样）。\n\n回来的不是强盗，而是一只小恶魔。\n\n龙傀儡像往常一样用双颚咬住了它，可我见小恶魔既没有武器，也根本没打算施法，便命令龙傀儡退开。我向它道歉，处理好它的伤口，然后请它解释我的实验对象遭遇了什么。原来恶魔也在进行自己的传送门实验！实验对象出现在它们的实验室时毫发无损；恶魔“审问”过他后（还用上了沸腾的焦油），意识到传送门另一边还有一位富有探究欲的研究者，希望与那人交流，或许还能交换数据。我的研究进展已经超过了恶魔——要么我是个天才，要么我严重高估了恶魔的威胁！\n\n我已经“正式”同意这笔交易：它们向我提供材料、实验对象和它们那一点点研究进展；作为回报，我研制了一颗改造水晶球，这颗水晶球在传送门中使用时就会向它们提供读数。不用说，读数全是假的；它们若真想利用这些读数另造一座传送门，只会把自己炸成碎片。它们交给我的数据却非常有用！我靠那些数据从零开始造好了第二座祭坛。它仍与恶魔领域有所连接，但只要用真正的多元水晶球传送一次，祭坛就会重新校准，彻底切断连接，让我带着自己的知识和财宝全身而退，也让恶魔再也无法抵达我这里。\n\n现在，我只需赶在恶魔察觉上当之前弄到一颗真正的水晶球……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b8c55b1174725ed15ce03cec0c6a766e5b2eb399d7d1f84c7c2dc1d63fbe8b07","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"653ac34b061d86dda64d46798253b7e009efbfd0c75834c75ac5f3fba666b3d3","logical_entry_identity":"56728a917b2fecfcc37c847660b52fa8211736161226cb56a0a544bd2aeb4e54","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Untouched by the ravages of time, this fine spun white cloak appears to be crafted of an otherworldly material that shifts and shimmers in the light.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这件精致的白色斗篷由异界材料制成，随光线变化而闪烁，永恒如新。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c3e1f06ff47f2f75a0040d3297957dfb28544da572b0cd58663a8d837a67ae06","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"653f6c194a9c97f4eacae598b6f5d27272e916a5ccbf94cbe10b42dd22885a91","logical_entry_identity":"0cc828c3d1a1fcaa44ae67060707ceca00f18fb9fb2287168a702ae832b3708c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Swiftly leap to your target and strike at their vital points with both weapons, dealing %d%% weapon damage. This attack deals %d%% increased critical strike damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"迅速跃向目标，用两把武器发动一次强力的突刺攻击，造成 %d%% 武器伤害，该次攻击暴击伤害系数增加 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b2224be708fbf02b1d075acc874d40e67912d91e12dca6aeae6281484fa625f3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6545b123b78bf1e47d66ac730ae8ff11ea22ba8f1472c7bf6e5b3a7b091bc512","logical_entry_identity":"9977313de918ecb54e007f355d7cbf1e3a81e1416ae973d1a8065a9cbe24f2d1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Shield Block Value#LAST#\nThe amount of damage a shield will block when actively used in defense.\nUsually this is only effective against Physical damage, but some special shields (and talents) allow the wearer to block other types.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#盾牌格挡值#LAST#\n盾牌在激活时所能阻挡的伤害量。\n通常只对物理伤害有效，但一些特殊的盾牌（和技能）可以让装备者格挡其他类型的伤害。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b4fbff9e770cf3002e8c7b071dfb746f513c62e86e12bfd15b23bebf99c9761a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6547b1b0d64196c21b8c9c242ba01fa1bbd0c46c92bb23a8d27e0285bb2bc7df","logical_entry_identity":"1be0b571c0eec7408eeef9f0dfd7d6e0974d2bcee59a73db477b2339627ecdf0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shimmer Demo","source_tag":"_t","tar