,"source":"Air","source_tag":"_t","target":"空气量"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"290702cd1663f8ded29b540dbfc4524c581e8246b278dba38781bcfd989c7c6a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6568f6a899182c3e1adf66904b32110c6c1bd35961e4e1abfd08b39c787319e2","logical_entry_identity":"a6b87152eab576cf4f5324beef08b146c1b02c725bde393531bb5db6c5272415","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"New Talent Category: #LIGHT_GREEN#Stone","source_tag":"_t","target":"新的技能树：#LIGHT_GREEN#石系"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"21a93f0b24628411638cf771635d52e70a661aa248e10432c14b50ae3115d442","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"656c9e04813eaea9304c87447e72b6ecf3dffcfe6f564592e00fbb4c316c151f","logical_entry_identity":"20096acfbf871db60a9f49cdcf0bd0e1a3f3a962a92b57b27b96b286beafc2bd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Temporal Augmentation Robe - Designed In-Style","source_tag":"entity name","target":"时空增益·引领时尚"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"97bc262310db6abbc4e076325928cddc7165b510153f7ae70d4d2c59078f6ece","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"656ed03e0f1212a7fde37f92facf17fd072cf2cf4d539afb9c781f6ee89350b3","logical_entry_identity":"2c16f7d6e020d53b49a07196a07d6845b6ab2dfb928b705aeed3ea0616b58c91","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Acquisition","source_tag":"calendar dwarf","target":"采购祭"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"35d9ac1644af6a1cf8bba62c0fc3147bb50b7ebda61342c3de659a582ba8a09e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6572a9285cad14ccccdb80c2c81218c2b93b0035c993f212dea6048e7fb8036a","logical_entry_identity":"a101e153d791aa895a7c1318eea18302d84f742dc79fd7af15ae954713b29d28","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A closer look at this pure white staff reveals that it is really a plethora of colors swirling and scintillating.","source_tag":"_t","target":"对这根纯净的白色法杖近距离欣赏会发现很多种颜色在上面盘旋闪耀。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f66f61dd6b12f7bfa9858a9f6c10840828dce15eac3b75abb36cc4dc8e64db72","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6573f0d2195e927ae8afe4ef4f2dd58bf4c7aa4e85881a643a9a6f2d0f88f3bd","logical_entry_identity":"cb056add00b0a2530679b4983306fc337e515c5051745341db8138f7d110732b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Willful Strike","source_tag":"talent name","target":"偏执打击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ce8a065fde9fa6424d44422679c53e20440b9b478ba14d6f1ccbf72d6401d870","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"657bc98de1c278bd31892ce3fdfad27766defd6a133711f555a3f86972e1dcbd","logical_entry_identity":"36b27412630ef2305c839437df246cbaf2f26c744153e261816d5e09e31f2e9c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Miniboss round starts!!","source_tag":"log","target":"#GOLD#小BOSS回合开始！！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3459afed156f20b59f3d374f377e9fb052a399b42f289109073c40a2a59d6fe9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"658569a12eac5160739babc5fc88f49c37464db0e4188474ca39e44a40a070ef","logical_entry_identity":"057f74edab82563ac32fe32bd80458fe0a42f4eb9901a92f51c76345a265b99d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#From the notes of Darwood Oakton, explorer:\n#{bold}#CHAPTER FIVE: HORR...\n\n#{italic}#This note seems hastily written and stained with water and blood.\n\n#{normal}#I... I haven't got long.\nThe key is here, but I never ... the door.\n\nI was unprepared! The trees I could avoid, the water I ... traverse, but beyond...\nHorrors ... tentacles ... blazing light that burned in an instant ...\nMy flesh devoured, my mind shattered ... worms, alive, walking tog ...\n... barely escaped. But my wounds are too ... blood won't stop ...\n\nI thought the Sher'Tul wonderful, I was entranced ... every facet of knowledge I could gain ...\nBut this, is this their legacy? ... horrifying ... all my dreams ... Perhaps death is welcome now...\n\nIf any come after, I bid you turn ... horrors ... too much. If you are foolish enough to ... my only advice is to ...\n\n#{italic}#You find with the note a tiny, faintly glowing orb - is this the key the note mentions?\n#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#摘自探险家达沃德·欧卡顿的笔记：\n#{bold}#第五章：恐……\n\n#{italic}#这张笔记似乎写得极其仓促，还沾着水和血。\n\n#{normal}#我……我没多少时间了。\n钥匙就在这里，但我始终没能……那扇门。\n\n我毫无准备！树木我还能躲开，水域我能……横渡，可越过之后……\n\n恐魔……触手……炽烈强光，刹那间灼烧……\n我的血肉被吞噬，心智支离破碎……虫子，活着，成群行……\n……我才勉强逃脱。可我的伤太……血止不住……\n\n我曾以为夏·图尔无比神奇，令我着迷……渴求能得到的每一分知识……\n\n可这，这就是他们的遗产吗？……太可怕了……我所有的梦想……或许死亡如今反倒是一种解脱……\n\n若有人随后来到这里，我劝你回……恐怖……承受不住。若你愚蠢到还要……我唯一的忠告是……\n\n#{italic}#你在笔记旁找到一颗微微发光的小球——这就是笔记里提到的钥匙吗？#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef0601e1c7eeffaa0633f68204b94fa88175d0cecdf546791ece5abaa843ee61","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"65880cb2eb75a35b9c16ad229d314a4bd77401f2afde8a95860cd5fbd46d3d77","logical_entry_identity":"b9efb1cbe2be0b28fddbfc43143040ca89cddda2d7c433d0eadcc8672d10c6da","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cave bear","source_tag":"entity name","target":"穴居熊"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9c46d07070c736b3f87424c586b4c52ee2c672367f2103aa155ef50b62a8728a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"658e32e3fc8a529ea880d85485ff117459734fdc9b31a58e2f7a4daf3b1ea8c6","logical_entry_identity":"254dbaad4e8c5899bd4e241e28f8eeef703ade7bea83c192c0e620f4dcae962f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#F53CBE#Your hate has conquered a great adversary!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#F53CBE#你的仇恨战胜了强大的对手！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef12a274f61ccb80770b045bceee4847fbd308b16b69cef6002e479e5d62eee3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"659974e034fd0a7155dcf4e24038a577702a7356918c90e036a60ee3e69d4817","logical_entry_identity":"87d7de432ae398e4dbee78eed9795cc4ac68e2fb0714f7aff03a741b3a3e6de3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Necromancer","source_tag":"entity name","target":"死灵法师"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"453cd6e84180e51c5b9392ed9958020073544d19f259bb93cc4d3e9c3d4cb53b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"65a7199982e464e2d63774389dd919bbaf6e8d07c51feb2b8079acbd71a2b997","logical_entry_identity":"57d304d6ee9ea3a30b75